"وَقَدْ خَابَ مَن دَسَّاهَا","english":"But the one who corrupts himself (in sins and suppresses virtue) is doomed indeed.","roots_ordered":["قد","خيب","من","دسو"],"tokens_ordered":["وقد","خاب","دساها"],"vec_preview":[-0.006500000134110451,0.028999999165534973,-0.009499999694526196,0.017799999564886093,0.04610000178217888,0.02160000056028366,0.016899999231100082,0.014700000174343586]},{"ayah_id":"91:11","surah":91,"ayah":11,"arabic":"كَذَّبَتْ ثَمُودُ بِطَغْوَاهَا","english":"The people of Thamud rejected (their Messenger Salih) due to their rebellion.","roots_ordered":["كذب","ثمد","طغو"],"tokens_ordered":["كذبت","ثمود","بطغواها"],"vec_preview":[0.007600000128149986,0.0658000037074089,-0.013000000268220901,0.02979999966919422,0.03440000116825104,-0.011599999852478504,0.031599998474121094,0.014999999664723873]},{"ayah_id":"91:12","surah":91,"ayah":12,"arabic":"إِذِ انبَعَثَ أَشْقَاهَا","english":"When the most wretched of them stood up,","roots_ordered":["اذ","بعث","شقي"],"tokens_ordered":["انبعث","اشقاها"],"vec_preview":[-0.012199999764561653,0.050200000405311584,-0.013700000010430813,0.021400000900030136,0.023499999195337296,0.014000000432133675,-0.0,0.01549999974668026]},{"ayah_id":"91:13","surah":91,"ayah":13,"arabic":"فَقَالَ لَهُمْ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ نَاقَةَ اللَّهِ وَسُقْيَاهَا","english":"Allah’s Messenger said to them: ‘Guard (that) she-camel and (the time of) her taking water.’","roots_ordered":["قول","ل","رسل","اله","نوق","سقي"],"tokens_ordered":["فقال","لهم","رسول","الله","ناقة","وسقياها"],"vec_preview":[0.021900000050663948,0.04809999838471413,-0.010999999940395355,0.007699999958276749,0.024800000712275505,-0.008700000122189522,0.02459999918937683,-0.0012000000569969416]},{"ayah_id":"91:14","surah":91,"ayah":14,"arabic":"فَكَذَّبُوهُ فَعَقَرُوهَا فَدَمْدَمَ عَلَيْهِمْ رَبُّهُم بِذَنبِهِمْ فَسَوَّاهَا","english":"But they rejected the Messenger and hamstrung (the she-camel). So because of their sin, their Lord sent down destruction on them, and levelled (the